# AllN1 Psych — Cursor Rules
# This file is read by Cursor before every prompt. It is the source of truth.

## WHAT YOU ARE BUILDING
AllN1 Psych — an Emotional Intelligence Operating System. A mobile app that teaches humans about their emotions, listens without judgment via AI, and quietly connects people who love each other through a "temperature" system.

This is NOT a therapy app. NOT a meditation app. NOT a mood tracker. It is a personal life companion and the life manual nobody ever gave you. It helps people who will NEVER do therapy — which is most humans.

## TECH STACK (Do not deviate)
- Expo SDK 54 + React Native + TypeScript
- Expo Router (file-based navigation)
- Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Realtime + Storage)
- React Query (@tanstack/react-query) for data fetching
- Zustand for local state management
- Expo AV for voice recording
- Voice transcription via Whisper API or Deepgram
- AI conversations via OpenAI or Claude API
- Expo Notifications for push notifications

## APP STRUCTURE (5 Bottom Tabs)
1. **Home** — Dashboard: current mood, temperature gauge, daily intention, quick action buttons ("Talk to me", "Check in", "Practice"), recent conversation summaries, circle status
2. **Talk** — Voice-first AI companion: large centered microphone button, conversation bubbles below, text input toggle at bottom. This is the CORE screen.
3. **Learn** — Emotional education modules: age-adaptive content, progress tracking, daily lesson queue, "recommended for you" based on conversations
4. **Circle** — Temperature system: your circle members with their temperatures, your own temperature (editable), nudge history, invite/manage members, relationship settings
5. **Me** — Profile & journal: private journal entries, weekly/monthly AI insights, settings, role play history, achievements, crisis resources always accessible

## FILE STRUCTURE
```
app/
  (tabs)/
    index.tsx          # Home dashboard
    talk.tsx           # AI companion (voice-first)
    learn.tsx          # Education modules
    circle.tsx         # Temperature & connections
    me.tsx             # Profile, journal, settings
